Responsive Design Quick Reference Guide

## Mobile, Tablet & Desktop Optimization

### Breakpoint Summary

| Device | Width | Grid Cols | Example |
|--------|-------|-----------|----------|
| **Mobile** | < 640px | 1 | iPhone SE, Galaxy S21 |
| **Tablet** | 641-1024px | 2 | iPad, Galaxy Tab |
| **Desktop** | 1025px+ | 3+ | Laptop, Monitor |

---

## 1. Using Responsive Typography

### CSS Variables (Predefined)
```css
--text-xs:    0.75rem   (12px)
--text-sm:    0.875rem  (14px)
--text-base:  1rem      (16px)
--text-lg:    1.125rem  (18px)
--text-xl:    1.25rem   (20px)
--text-2xl:   1.875rem  (30px)
--text-3xl:   2.25rem   (36px)
--text-4xl:   3rem      (48px)
--text-5xl:   3.75rem   (60px)
```

### Usage
```html
<h1>Normal heading</h1>
<h1 class="text-responsive-lg">Responsive large heading</h1>
<p class="text-responsive">Responsive paragraph</p>
<small class="text-responsive-sm">Responsive small text</small>
```

### Automatic Scaling
```css
/* These scale automatically based on viewport */
.text-responsive { font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.5rem); }
.text-responsive-lg { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
```

---

## 2. Creating Responsive Buttons

### HTML
```html
<button class="btn btn-primary">Click Me</button>
<a href="#" class="btn btn-secondary">Learn More</a>
```

### Features
- ✅ Automatic 48px minimum height on mobile
- ✅ Full width on mobile, auto on tablet/desktop
- ✅ Touch-friendly padding
- ✅ Responsive font sizing

### Customize Button Size
```css
/* Mobile buttons */
@media (max-width: 640px) {
    .custom-btn {
        padding: 12px 16px;  /* Smaller on mobile */
        width: 100%;
    }
}

/* Desktop buttons */
@media (min-width: 1025px) {
    .custom-btn {
        padding: 14px 32px;  /* Larger on desktop */
        width: auto;
    }
}
```

---

## 3. Responsive Form Inputs

### HTML
```html
<input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email" required>
<textarea placeholder="Your message"></textarea>
<select>
    <option>Choose an option</option>
</select>
```

### Features
- ✅ Font size 16px on mobile (prevents zoom)
- ✅ Minimum 44px height (touch-friendly)
- ✅ Clear focus states
- ✅ Custom dropdown styling

### Input Focus Styling
```css
/* Blue outline on focus */
input:focus {
    border-color: #4F46E5;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.1);
}
```

---

## 4. Responsive Grids

### Mobile-First Grid
```html
<div class="grid">
    <div>Card 1</div>
    <div>Card 2</div>
    <div>Card 3</div>
</div>
```

### Automatic Behavior
```
Mobile:  [Card1]
         [Card2]
         [Card3]

Tablet:  [Card1] [Card2]
         [Card3]

Desktop: [Card1] [Card2] [Card3]
```

### Custom Grid
```css
/* Define custom grid */
.my-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 1.5rem;
}

/* Will automatically adapt to all screen sizes */
```

---

## 5. Responsive Spacing

### Using Spacing Classes
```html
<!-- Responsive spacing that adapts to screen size -->
<section class="spacing-responsive">Large content area</section>
<div class="spacing-responsive-sm">Small spacing</div>
```

### Manual Spacing
```css
/* Mobile */
@media (max-width: 640px) {
    section { padding: 1rem; margin: 1rem; }
}

/* Tablet */
@media (min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px) {
    section { padding: 2rem; margin: 1.5rem; }
}

/* Desktop */
@media (min-width: 1025px) {
    section { padding: 3rem; margin: 2rem; }
}
```

### Using CSS Variables
```css
section {
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    margin: var(--space-xl);
}
```

---

## 6. Hiding/Showing Content

### Show/Hide by Device
```html
<!-- Hide on mobile, show on larger screens -->
<div class="hide-mobile">Desktop-only content</div>

<!-- Show only on mobile -->
<div class="show-mobile">Mobile-only content</div>

<!-- Hide on tablet and larger -->
<div class="show-tablet hide-desktop">Tablet content</div>
```

### Manual Implementation
```css
/* Hide on mobile */
@media (max-width: 640px) {
    .desktop-only { display: none; }
}

/* Show on tablet */
@media (min-width: 641px) {
    .mobile-only { display: none; }
}
```

---

## 7. Touch-Friendly Navigation

### Hamburger Menu
```html
<button class="hamburger" aria-label="Menu">
    <span></span>
    <span></span>
    <span></span>
</button>

<nav class="navbar" id="navbar">
    <!-- Menu items -->
</nav>
```

### JavaScript Handler
```javascript
const hamburger = document.querySelector('.hamburger');
const navbar = document.getElementById('navbar');

hamburger.addEventListener('click', () => {
    navbar.classList.toggle('active');
    hamburger.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 
        hamburger.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true' ? 'false' : 'true'
    );
});
```

---

## 8. Responsive Images

### Lazy Loading
```html
<!-- Images load only when visible -->
<img src="image.jpg" alt="Description" loading="lazy">
```

### Responsive Image Sizes
```html
<!-- Image scales with container -->
<img src="image.jpg" alt="Responsive" class="img-responsive">

<!-- Maintains aspect ratio -->
<img src="image.jpg" alt="Thumbnail" class="img-thumbnail">
```

### Picture Element (Advanced)
```html
<picture>
    <source srcset="mobile.jpg" media="(max-width: 640px)">
    <source srcset="tablet.jpg" media="(max-width: 1024px)">
    <img src="desktop.jpg" alt="Responsive image">
</picture>
```

---

## 9. Accessibility on All Devices

### Touch Target Sizes
```css
/* All interactive elements: minimum 48px */
button, a, input {
    min-height: 48px;
    min-width: 48px;
}
```

### Focus States
```css
input:focus,
button:focus,
a:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #4F46E5;
    outline-offset: 2px;
}
```

### Keyboard Navigation
```css
/* Support Tab key navigation */
a:focus-visible,
button:focus-visible,
input:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid #4F46E5;
}
```

---

## 10. Media Query Quick Reference

### Breakpoint Syntax
```css
/* Mobile First Approach */
/* 1. Default: Mobile styles */
body { font-size: 15px; }

/* 2. Add tablet styles */
@media (min-width: 641px) {
    body { font-size: 16px; }
}

/* 3. Add desktop styles */
@media (min-width: 1025px) {
    body { font-size: 17px; }
}
```

### Viewport Conditions
```css
/* Hide on mobile */
@media (max-width: 640px) {
    .desktop-only { display: none; }
}

/* Tablet only */
@media (min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px) {
    /* Tablet styles */
}

/* Desktop and larger */
@media (min-width: 1025px) {
    /* Desktop styles */
}

/* Landscape orientation */
@media (orientation: landscape) {
    /* Landscape styles */
}

/* Touch devices */
@media (hover: none) and (pointer: coarse) {
    /* Touch device styles */
}

/* Desktop/Mouse devices */
@media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
    /* Desktop styles */
}
```

---

## 11. Testing Checklist

### Mobile Testing
- [ ] Text readable without zoom
- [ ] Buttons at least 48x48px
- [ ] Forms don't trigger zoom on focus
- [ ] Navigation works (hamburger menu)
- [ ] Images scale properly
- [ ] No horizontal scroll

### Tablet Testing
- [ ] 2-column layout active
- [ ] Proper spacing between elements
- [ ] Touch targets comfortable
- [ ] Landscape mode works
- [ ] Images at correct size

### Desktop Testing
- [ ] 3-column layout active
- [ ] Hover effects work
- [ ] Proper whitespace
- [ ] Readability optimal
- [ ] Full navigation visible

---

## 12. Common Patterns

### Responsive Container
```css
.container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--space-md);
}

@media (min-width: 641px) {
    .container { padding: 0 var(--space-lg); }
}
```

### Responsive Card
```css
.card {
    background: white;
    border-radius: var(--border-radius-medium);
    padding: var(--space-md);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    transition: all var(--transition-fast);
}

@media (min-width: 1025px) {
    .card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-5px);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
    }
}
```

### Responsive Flex
```css
.flex-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
}

@media (min-width: 641px) {
    .flex-container {
        flex-direction: row;
        gap: var(--space-lg);
    }
}
```

